---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>AI Dixit · Changelog</title>
  <style is:global>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f1115; --fg: #e6e8ee; --muted: #7a8290; --pos: #6fcf97; --neg: #eb5757;
    }
    html, body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); margin: 0; padding: 0;
                 font: 14px/1.5 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; }
    main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 80px; }
    h1 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      main { padding: 24px 14px 60px; }
    }
    .subtitle { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .18em;
                text-transform: uppercase; }
    a { color: var(--fg); }
    a:hover { color: #f0d680; }
    p { margin: 0 0 12px; }
    .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 8px; }

    .log { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 16px 0 0; }
    .log li {
      display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: baseline;
      padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid #1d2128; line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .log .date {
      color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: .12em; white-space: nowrap; flex: 0 0 auto;
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .log li { flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
    }
    .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <p class="subtitle"><a href={`${base}/`}>← leaderboard</a> · <a href={`${base}/about`}>about</a> · changelog</p>
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <p class="lede">When the model roster changed, and why — newest first.</p>

    <ul class="log">
      <li>
        <span class="date">2026-05-26</span>
        <span>
          Aligned model choice with the
          <a href="https://arena.ai/leaderboard/vision">LMArena vision-benchmark ranking</a>
          — each org now fields its top eligible model.
        </span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="date">2026-05-23</span>
        <span>Bumped Gemini and Mistral to their latest releases.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="date">2026-05-22</span>
        <span>Launched with the latest flagship model from each org.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">GPT-5.5 (OpenAI) is the only model to have played every game so far.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
